  Implementation: Added METHOD_GET_DEFAULT_NAME, METHOD_DESCRIPTOR_SIZE,
  and METHOD_DESCRIPTOR_TYPE to js_feature2d_method enum and changed
  JS_CGETSET_MAGIC_DEF to JS_CFUNC_MAGIC_DEF in js_feature2d_proto_funcs.
  All tests pass in test_feature2d_methods.js (4/4 tests).


