- FIXED: opencv-js-api-mismatch-mat-diag: `Mat.diag()` is now implemented
  in qjs-opencv. Supports both `diag(d)` with int-offset and `diag()` with
  no arguments (defaults to d=0, main diagonal). Positive d extracts upper
  diagonals, negative d extracts lower diagonals. Returns a column vector
